# Export presets name an export TEMPLATE by absolute path, because the
# installed templates are 4.7.stable while the pinned engine is 4.7.2 —
# so the preset is machine-specific by nature. Copy the example, put your
# own path in it, and keep it out of the history.
export_presets.cfg

# Local pointer to CONTRIBUTING.md, for tooling that looks for this name.
# The house rules themselves are in CONTRIBUTING.md, which IS committed.
CLAUDE.md
